FountainOcean: Forces surrounding biome state to Ocean upon activation
FountainDesert: Forces surrounding biome state to Desert upon activation
FountainJungle: Forces surrounding biome state to Jungle upon activation
FountainSnow: Forces surrounding biome state to Snow upon activation
FountainCorruption: Forces surrounding biome state to Corruption upon activation
FountainCrimson: Forces surrounding biome state to Crimson upon activation
FountainHallow: Forces surrounding biome state to Hallow (in hardmode only) upon activation
CatchNPCs: Can also catch townsfolk
ExtraLure1: Also grants one extra lure
Lures2: Fires 2 lures at once
Lures3: Fires 3 lures at once
Lures5: Fires 5 lures at once
AutoTorch: Automatically swaps placed torches to boost luck
TrueTorchLuck: Obeys true torch luck when replacing torches, which may differ from default choices
UnlimitedBuff30: Unlimited buff at {0} stack in inventory, portable storage or Potion Cooler
UnlimitedUse30: Unlimited use at 30 stack
PermanentEffectNearby: Permanently provides {0} buff to nearby players when placed
WorksFromBanks: Inventory effects also work from Piggy Bank and Safe
SoldBySquirrel: Sold By Squirrel: When obtained
SomeMaterialsSold: Some Materials Sold By Squirrel: When obtained
CraftableMaterialsSold: Craftable Materials Sold By Squirrel: When obtained
SoldAtThirtyStack: Sold By Squirrel: When obtained at 30-stack
SoldBy: Sold By
SeveralVendors: several vendors
SacrificablePlural: Can be fed to the Squirrel {0} more times
Sacrificable: Can be fed to the Squirrel 1 more time
SacrificeEvent: Feed to the Squirrel for a special event
SacrificeEventPlural: Feed {0} to the Squirrel for a special event
EnchantedTreeDupable: Can be duplicated with Enchanted Tree
ScopeViewToggle: Binocular vision disabled
Shimmerable: Shimmerable into
ShimmerableFrom: Shimmerable from
ShimmerableBoth: Shimmerable from and into
TreeTreasure: Obtainable from LumberJack Tree Treasures
FasterBedSpeed: Further fast forwards time by {0}x when fully asleep
PermanentEffectNearbyPickup: Once obtained, permanently provides {0} buff to nearby players when placed
HerbFertilizer: Can be Extractinated into Herb Fertilizer
